                "text": "I had a great meeting with the Florida Health Care Association, which represents 600+ nursing centers in our state. In Congress, I will always oppose cuts to Medicaid, which would threaten long-term care facilities and the health care of hundreds of thousands of Floridians. https://t.co/OmYtzZlaOX",
