                "text": "Dumile Wagner was born and raised in Venezuela and moved to Florida 11 years ago. As she\u2019s worked her way from the medical-surgical unit to ICU Nurse Manager, Dumile is known for her compassion, leadership, and unshakable pride in her heritage. https://t.co/KpA0uUhJeK",
